      ***************************************************************
      * FILE NAME : MCFPCS7400
      * FILE TYPE : PHYSICAL FILE
      *
      * PURPOSE   : PO UPD PROGRAMS
      *
      * CREATED   : 03/06/2003
      * AUTHOR    : EXLTECH, INC - DAN RAUCH
      *****************************************************************
      * SPECIAL NOTES:
      *                ONLY PROGRAM NAMES FOUND IN THIS FILE CAN UPDATE
      * A PO AND TRIGGER A LOG RECORD TO BE WRITTEN VIA CPOLOG. THE
      * ACTUAL LOGGING EVENT IS CONTROLLED EITHER EXTERNALLY BY THE APP
      * PROGRAM DOING THE UPD OR BY TRIGGER PROGRAM CPOUPDTRG DEPENDING
      * ON THE VALUE OF LOGTIME FLAG:
      *
      *                LOGTIME = "T" OR "X"
      *                "T" = LOGGING DONE @ TRIGGER TIME
      *                "X" = LOGGING DONE EXTERNALLY BY APP PROGRAM
      *****************************************************************
     A                                      UNIQUE
     A                                      REF(STORES)
     A          R MCFRCS7400
     A            PROGNAME      10A
     A            LOGTIME        1A
     A          K PROGNAME
